{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enter ATLYSS,</strong></i><strong> a strange world thriving with creatures and critters!</strong> With the outside realm and dungeons deep ahead, there are plenty of locations to explore and discover.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Character Creation -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character with <strong>five playable races to choose from,</strong> with color, head, and body customization!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Class Advancement -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start off as a witty Novice, destined to choose between three primary classes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighter:</strong> The melee class that rends and staggers foes, dealing devastating damage and threat. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic:</strong> The caster class that evokes powerful offensive and supportive arcane magic to their advantage. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bandit:</strong> The acrobatic class that are experts of ranged weapons, traps, and quick melee attacks. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Play alone, or with Friends -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience ATLYSS with friends online, or play solo--</strong> <i>no internet connection required!</i>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Your character, saved locally -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All of your character progression data is saved locally!</strong> Play a character solo, and join in later to a net-play session where you left off, and vice versa. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Questing Abound -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party up with friends and take on quests to slay creatures, discover new locations, and uncover the mystique of the shattered world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/8ac037ac22321a03f39e78889072b1ab1036a847.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing Catacombs (1-6)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/1b51ecaf10ba1dd6bdc086a6ae68fe2e7ae264ec.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing Catacombs (6-12)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/589bd4addd0f10fdd0c13134c518f433ce1f7aba.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing Catacombs (12-18)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/57b1c876feef509666e57a95402bcc2f2fdfaa0d.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/720cf4632becb41f882e8f4b605f6e6ad7719e31.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Mystic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/aefa25e86e742a64faeebec45744c2ccafb60e99.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Bandit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/abcc0d237987e37e8fe04ff3ba7c8de99e11d8c1.jpg"},{"name":"Clearing Grove (15-20)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/8ac2f62c92ab67ce8d7a5a3d5f52f3ade18cd427.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion Sense","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/13dcef1cd174447769ccff8208afd93cd9732d42.jpg"},{"name":"Altered Vision","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2768430/351b12d4ea0da28adc083ba9243ad51c561a3b7e.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768430?t=1764521441","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2768430?t=1764521441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764521441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item